    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hwilan Wentsæte hyrdan into Dunsætan; ac hit gebyreð rihtor into Westsexan: ðyder hy scylan gafol ⁊ gislas syllan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Formerly the Wentsæte [people of Gwent] came under [the political authority] of [those] in Dunsæte, but that territory [Gwent] belongs more rightly to the West Saxons. They [the Wentsæte] should give tribute and hostages there [to the West Saxons].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Aliquando Ƿentsete parebant in Dunsetas; sed pertinet rectius ad Ƿestsexam; illuc debent gabli plegios dare.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
